# "Cards exiled with this creature" are those its own ability exiled (CR 607.2a), and a permanent that leaves and returns is a new
# object (CR 400.7) that nothing was exiled with. Bot1's Dawnhand Dissident surveils Llanowar Elves into the graveyard on turn three
# and exiles them on turn five (blighting its Sylvan Caryatid twice), then is flickered by Ephemerate: the Dissident that returns
# (without its -1/-1 counter) did not exile the Elves. On turn seven it blights itself to surveil, so there are three counters among
# Bot1's creatures, and with {G} open the Elves still can't be cast from exile. The twin that casts them is
# "...exiles-a-creature-and-casts-it-removing-counters-of-two-kinds".

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dawnhand Dissident
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Caryatid
Ephemerate
Plains
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dawnhand Dissident.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Caryatid.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Choose(Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Llanowar Elves)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Exile target)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Choose(Sylvan Caryatid)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Toughness = 2
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Choose(Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Forest |)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
! Bot1.Exile.Llanowar Elves.Cast

[Expect]
Exile = Ephemerate; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 2
